  "spiel": "tnc",
  "priority": 150,
  "description": "Makes the developer menu's map entries load again (307 starts). Each entry now runs devmap with the spawn spot and layers the missing loadDevMenuOption command would have used. 126 of them also run their dev teleport after loading again: a marker layer in the entry and a small addition to 12 map scripts send the stock events. Not included: chapter progression, the two 'give' lines, and the DLC maps' dev teleports. Loading maps from the menu is confirmed in game; the dev teleports are not yet. The entries 'WolfSDK: Mod test map' and 'WolfSDK: Box' need maps this package does not build yet.",
